Total physical RAM = 16 GB
Number of VMs = 5
Minimum RAM per VM = 2 GB
Host OS requirement = 4 GB
Required RAM
VM requirement:
   5×2=10GB
Host requirement:
   4GB
Total:
10+4=14GB
Available:
16GB
